{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32947","headline":"美人尝茶行 · 崔珏","name":"美人尝茶行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"云鬟枕落困春泥，玉郎爲碾瑟瑟尘。\n闲教鹦鹉啄窗响，和娇扶起浓睡人。\n银瓶贮泉水一掬，松雨声来乳花熟。\n朱唇啜破绿云时，咽入香喉爽红玉。\n明眸渐开横秋水，手拨丝簧醉心起。\n台时却坐推金筝，不语思量梦中事。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔珏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32947.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32947","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}